title: "SCIX Exoplanet Search (SXS): Reproducible Kepler Transit Recovery and Independent Vetting"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Andrean"
    given-names: "Rasya"
    affiliation: "Science Experimental Technologies"
version: 1.3.0
date-released: 2026-09-04
license-url: "https://github.com/Science-Experimental-Technologies/Exoplanet-Search/blob/main/LICENSE"
