contact:
  - name: "Science Experimental Technologies"
    email: "scix.official@gmail.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Science-Experimental-Technologies/Exoplanet-Search"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible computational astronomy pipeline for Kepler light-curve
  acquisition, preprocessing, Box Least Squares transit recovery,
  target-grouped machine-learning vetting, bounded candidate search, and
  independent statistical validation. The archived research reports no strong
  candidates, one weak candidate, and nineteen likely false positives; it
  makes no confirmed-exoplanet or discovery claim.
keywords:
  - exoplanets
  - transit photometry
  - Kepler
  - TESS
  - reproducible research
  - machine learning
